<title>USA: Peapod IPO size and range increased - underwriter.</title>
<headline>Peapod IPO size and range increased - underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peapod Inc's initial public offering range has been increased to $15 - $16 from $13 - $15, said underwriter Smith Barney.</p>
<p>In addition, the size of the deal was increased to 4.0 million shares from 3.6 million shares.</p>
<p>Peapod is expected to price tonight for trade tomorrow on Nasdaq under the symbol PPOD.O.</p>
<p>Peapod is an online shopping and delivery service.</p>
</text>
